# Build-context filter for manually building the retained reference
# peripheral/email/Dockerfile from the repository root. Without this, a direct
# build would ship the whole repo (~2GB: .venv-cua, .git, state/) to the daemon.
# NB: orchestration/Dockerfile.control builds from context `orchestration` and
# is NOT affected by this file.
*
!peripheral/
!orchestration/
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
